### Control-plane lifecycle

```bash
bash scripts/gall/gall work dispatch {{ item.workItemId }}
# Implement only the admitted scope.
bash scripts/gall/gall work verify {{ item.workItemId }}
bash scripts/gall/gall work complete {{ item.workItemId }}
bash scripts/gall/gall tracker plan
bash scripts/gall/gall receipt verify
```

An external command agent may be invoked only when the automation profile admits it:

```bash
bash scripts/gall/gall work dispatch {{ item.workItemId }} --apply
```

